{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":17480,\"date\":\"2026-09-05T12:24:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-05T10:24:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"claude-arriva-su-carplay-conversazioni-hands-free-dall-auto\",\"title\":\"Claude arriva su CarPlay: conversazioni hands-free dall’auto\",\"excerpt\":\"L’app iOS di Claude integra CarPlay: gli utenti possono fare domande a voce e ricevere risposte dall’infotainment, con limiti su controllo di veicolo e funzioni iPhone.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/CarPlay-Liquid-Glass-Light-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"CarPlay-Liquid-Glass-Light\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17478,\"date\":\"2026-09-05T11:53:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-05T09:53:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-ultra-iphone-18-pro-anteprima-evento-9-settembre-2026\",\"title\":\"iPhone Ultra e iPhone 18 Pro: anteprima dell’evento Apple del 9 settembre\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple terrà l’evento “Surprise and Shine” mercoledì 9 settembre alle 10:00 (PT). Attesi iPhone Ultra pieghevole, iPhone 18 Pro con nuove fotocamere e aggiornamenti su Watch e AirPods.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/Everything-Apple-Is-Expected-to-Announce-At-Surprise-and-Shine-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Everything-Apple-Is-Expected-to-Announce-At-Surprise-and-Shine-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17452,\"date\":\"2026-09-05T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-05T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"m6-vs-m5-pro-guida-acquisto-mac-mini\",\"title\":\"M6 vs M5 Pro: guida all’acquisto del Mac mini\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple porta il chip M6 nel Mac mini entry-level e il M5 Pro nel modello più potente. Ecco differenze reali, limiti di memoria e scelte consigliate.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/mac-mini-2026-blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"mac-mini-2026-blue\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17450,\"date\":\"2026-09-04T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-04T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-iphone-handoff-stesso-numero-senza-spostare-esim\",\"title\":\"iOS 27 introduce iPhone Handoff: stesso numero su due iPhone senza spostare la eSIM\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 27 Apple prepara iPhone Handoff: passare da un iPhone all’altro mantenendo lo stesso numero di telefono, senza trasferire la eSIM.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iphone-handoff-ios-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-handoff-ios-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17345,\"date\":\"2026-09-01T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-01T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamere-audio-spaziale-rilevamento-schermo\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamere: audio spaziale più preciso grazie al rilevamento dello schermo\",\"excerpt\":\"Codice di macOS Tahoe 26.7 suggerisce che AirPods con fotocamere potrebbero migliorare il spatial audio individuando lo schermo guardato dall’utente e restringendo l’audio alla sorgente corretta.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/AirPods-Pro-4-With-Camera-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"AirPods-Pro-4-With-Camera-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\"